# Allow-list. Everything is left out of the VSIX unless a line below lets it back in, so a new file in the
# checkout (settings, notes, a copied transcript, evidence) cannot ship by accident.
**
!package.json
!README.md
!src/*.js
!media/app.js
!media/view.js
!media/style.css
!resources/agentviz.svg
# Explicit exclusions stay last so they win even if an allow rule above is widened later.
.git/**
.vscode/**
node_modules/**
artifacts/**
test/**
docs/**
HANDOFF.md
*.code-workspace
package-lock.json
.gitignore
ORCHESTRATION.md
workflows/**
.agentboard/**
.claude/**
**/*.jsonl
**/*.vsix
**/.env*
